[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=23 format=3]

; Menu widgets in the tug meter's language: ink slats at 94%, a hairline of
; cream, twelve-pixel corners, dirt gold for anything live and barn red for the
; button that starts a round. Content margins and font sizes are the shared
; theme's, so only the paint changes — see ui/tug_meter.gd for the original.

